        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)(ii)　赤玉3個を一つの塊にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "赤玉3個の順列は4P3通りです。残りの赤玉1個と白玉4個を並べ、その赤玉の両隣を避けた4箇所へ3個の塊を置きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{4\\cdot3\\cdot2\\cdot5!\\cdot4}{8!}=\\frac27",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)(iii)　2個の塊と単独赤玉を別の隙間へ置く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "赤玉2個の塊を作る順列は4P2通りです。白玉4個の5つの隙間に、塊1個と単独赤玉2個を一つずつ配置すれば、2連続箇所は一つだけになります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{4\\cdot3\\cdot4!\\cdot{}_5P_3}{8!}=\\frac37",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)(i)　対になる項ごとに相加相乗平均を使う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(a_1+2a_2+3a_3)\\left(\\frac1{a_1}+\\frac2{a_2}+\\frac3{a_3}\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "展開後、a2/a1とa1/a2のような対を作り、各対に相加相乗平均を適用します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\ge14+4+12+6=36",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "すべての等号が同時に成立するのはa1=a2=a3のときなので、最小値は36です。ベクトルのコーシー・シュワルツ不等式でも同じ結論を得られます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)(ii)　一般化した下限を三角数で表す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{n}ka_k\\right)\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\frac{k}{a_k}\\right)\\ge\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{n}k\\right)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "等号はa1=a2=…=anのときです。原本は数学的帰納法と、二次式の判別式を使う別解の二通りでこの不等式を示しています。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "帰納法ではn=mでの不等式を仮定し、n=m+1の積を展開して相加相乗平均を適用すると、右辺が1からm+1までの和の平方になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{m+1}k\\right)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(\\frac{n(n+1)}2\\right)^2=2025\\iff\\frac{n(n+1)}2=45",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "n^2+n-90=0\\iff(n+10)(n-9)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "nは自然数なのでn=9です。別解では任意の実数tについて成り立つ二次不等式を足し合わせ、判別式が0以下であることから同じ下限を導きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅱ問　データの分析（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "（1）",
                "value": "ア 6／イ 9／ウ 9／エ 3／オ 3／カ 6／キ 5／ク 9"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）",
                "value": "ケ 6／コ 4"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）",
                "value": "サ 9／シ 7／ス 5／セ 5"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　既知8人から平均と分散を確認する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "AからHを小さい順に並べると1,2,5,6,7,8,9,10。平均は6、偏差平方和は72なので分散は9です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{1+2+5+6+7+8+9+10}{8}=6",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "i+j=12,\\qquad(i-6)^2+(j-6)^2=18",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "i>jを使うとi=9,j=3です。10個を並べると1,2,3,5,6,7,8,9,9,10なので、第1四分位数3、中央値6.5、第3四分位数9です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　平均7を基準に偏差表を作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2(b-7)+(c-7)+5=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2(b-7)^2+(c-7)^2+9=20",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "第1式からc−7をb−7で表し、第2式へ代入します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "6(b-7)^2+20(b-7)+14=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "bが整数であることからb=6、平均条件へ戻してc=4です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　比較する10人の集団を区別する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "A〜Jの和は50。C〜Lの平均をmとするとA〜Jの平均はm−1なので、10(m−1)=50からm=6です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "k+l=16,\\qquad kl=63",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "0以上10以下の整数かつk>lよりk=9,l=7。12人の平均は(50+16)/12=5.5です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅲ問　2つの放物線（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "（1）",
                "value": "ア 3／イ 2／ウ 8／エ 4"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）",
                "value": "オ 2／カ 4／キ 9"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）",
                "value": "ク 2"
              },
              {
                "label": "（4）",
                "value": "ケ 2／コ 6／サ 1／シ 5／ス 5／セソ −3"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　2つの式を等置する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2(x-a)^2+(a-b)(x-a)-b=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=\\frac{3a+b\\pm\\sqrt{a^2-2ab+b^2+8b}}4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　x軸上の共有点条件を使う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "b=(b-a)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2≤b≤6でbは平方数なのでb=4。1≤a<bからa=2です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-parabola-overview",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\int_1^4\\{g(x)-f(x)\\}\\,dx=\\int_1^4(-2x^2+10x-8)\\,dx=9",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-enclosed-area",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　共有点方程式へx=1を代入する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(a-1)(a+b-2)=b",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "1≤a<b≤6を調べるとa=2のときだけ成立します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　象限ごとのx座標範囲を絞る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "1\\le x_1\\le a-1,\\qquad a+1\\le x_2\\le b-1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-quadrants",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kindai-2025-recommendation-general-public-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "第4象限の共有点をもつにはg(b−1)<0が必要です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "b<(b-a-1)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2≤a≤b−2、b≤6の整数候補を調べると(a,b)=(2,6)だけが適合します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=\\frac{12\\pm8}{4}=5,1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "f(x)=(x−2)(x−6)へ代入するとf(1)=5、f(5)=−3。よって第1象限の共有点は(1,5)、第4象限は(5,−3)です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "確認",
            "text": "候補の列挙だけでなく、最後に元の2式へ共有点を代入して一致を確認します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
